# Keeps the build context small, and keeps host artefacts out of the image.
# node_modules especially: copying a Windows install over the one npm just
# resolved inside the container is how a native binding ends up wrong.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
coverage
.git
.github
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
docs
*.md
# apps/web stays in the context: the API image copies only its package.json,
# which npm needs to read the workspace globs.
